OL,3,GNEWSA#1bn government housing boost for
OL,4,ANorth West
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is to give nearly #1bn
OL,7,Fto the North West to deliver about
OL,8,F7,500 new homes as part of plans to
OL,9,F"build the country out of a housing
OL,10,Fcrisis".
OL,12,FA share of up to #10bn has been
OL,13,Fannounced for councils and housing
OL,14,Fassociations nationally in the first
OL,15,Fwave of government funding to boost
OL,16,F"genuinely affordable homes".
OL,18,FGreater Manchester has been given the
OL,19,Flargest share of the six mayoral areas
OL,20,Fto benefit from this round, with
OL,21,FLiverpool City Region set to deliver
OL,22,F3,100 homes supported by #380m.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
