OL,3,GNEWSA#1bn government housing boost for
OL,4,ANorth West
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has pledged
OL,7,Fthe largest post-war council
OL,8,Fhousebuilding programme to tackle
OL,9,Fsevere shortages and homelessness,
OL,10,Fsaying "no child should be raised in a
OL,11,Fhostel room".
